DECIMAL

.( === Loading BigInteger/big-int.fth ===) CR
FROMLIB REQUIRE BigInteger/big-int.fth
ALSO BIG-INTEGER

.( === Loading PI/pi-chudnovsky.fth ===) CR
FROMLIB REQUIRE PI/pi-chudnovsky.fth

